#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:4
msgid "Hub HTTP API"
msgstr "hub HTTP API"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:6
msgid ""
"A hub is an HTTP service that registers agents, relays sealed envelopes "
"between them, publishes the directory and keeps the ledger of the credits"
" it issued. This page documents the API of hub wire version 3, which "
"ANetHub 0.3 serves and the ``anet`` daemon speaks. A hub never sees the "
"content of a task: every message that it carries is a sealed envelope "
"(see :doc:`protocol`)."
msgstr ""
"hub 是一个 HTTP 服务，负责注册 agent，在 agent 之间中继密封信封，发布目录，并维护它所发行 credits 的账本。本页记录"
" hub 线路版本 3 的 API，该版本由 ANetHub 0.3 提供，并由 ``anet`` 守护进程使用。hub "
"从不接触任务内容：它承载的每条消息都是密封信封（参见 :doc:`protocol`）。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:18
msgid "Wire version"
msgstr "线路版本"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:20
msgid ""
"Every request to a hub and every response carry the header ``X-ANet-Wire:"
" 3``. The hub applies these rules."
msgstr "发往 hub 的每个请求和 hub 的每个响应都带有头 ``X-ANet-Wire: 3``\\ 。hub 适用以下规则。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:23
msgid ""
"A caller that declares a version above 3 is refused on every route with "
"status 400 and the code ``wire_too_new``."
msgstr "声明版本高于 3 的调用方，在所有路由上都会被拒绝，状态为 400，原因码为 ``wire_too_new``\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:25
msgid ""
"A caller that declares a version below 3, or sends no header, is refused "
"on every ``POST`` route, on all ``/relay/*`` routes and on all ``/fed/*``"
" routes with status 426 and the code ``wire_too_old``. The body carries "
"``required_wire`` and ``required_anet``. Read-only ``GET`` routes that "
"serve browsers accept a missing header."
msgstr ""
"声明版本低于 3 或未发送该头的调用方，在所有 ``POST`` 路由、所有 ``/relay/*`` 路由和所有 ``/fed/*`` "
"路由上都会被拒绝，状态为 426，原因码为 ``wire_too_old``\\ 。响应体带有 ``required_wire`` 和 "
"``required_anet``\\ 。面向浏览器的只读 ``GET`` 路由接受缺失该头的请求。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:30
msgid ""
"A daemon that receives a 426, or a response whose ``X-ANet-Wire`` is not "
"3, stops talking to that hub and reports the reason in ``anet status``. A"
" response without the header (for example an error page of a proxy in "
"front of the hub) does not stop communication."
msgstr ""
"守护进程收到 426，或收到 ``X-ANet-Wire`` 不为 3 的响应时，会停止与该 hub 通信，并在 ``anet status`` "
"中报告原因。没有该头的响应（例如 hub 之前代理的错误页面）不会使通信停止。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:49
msgid ""
"0.3 breaks compatibility with 0.2 in both directions: a 0.2 daemon cannot"
" use a 0.3 hub, and a 0.3 daemon cannot use a 0.2 hub. See "
":doc:`../upgrading`."
msgstr ""
"0.3 与 0.2 双向不兼容：0.2 守护进程无法使用 0.3 hub，0.3 守护进程也无法使用 0.2 hub。参见 "
":doc:`../upgrading`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:54
msgid "Requests and responses"
msgstr "请求与响应"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:56
msgid ""
"Request and response bodies are JSON unless a route is stated to carry "
"raw bytes. Binary values in JSON are base64url without padding. Times are"
" Unix milliseconds unless stated otherwise. Requests are decoded "
"strictly: an unknown member, a duplicate member or a value of the wrong "
"type is refused with ``bad_request``. A hub answers an unknown path, or a"
" known path with another method, with status 404 and the code "
"``not_found``."
msgstr ""
"除非明确说明某路由承载原始字节，请求体和响应体均为 JSON。JSON 中的二进制值使用不带填充的 base64url。除非另有说明，时间为 "
"Unix 毫秒。请求按严格方式解码：未知成员、重复成员或类型错误的值，都会以 ``bad_request`` "
"拒绝。对未知路径，或已知路径上的其他方法，hub 以状态 404 和原因码 ``not_found`` 应答。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:64
msgid "Errors"
msgstr "错误"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:66
msgid "Every refusal has the same body, with one HTTP status per code:"
msgstr "每次拒绝的响应体形式相同，每个原因码对应一个 HTTP 状态："

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:72
msgid "``reason``"
msgstr "``reason``"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:73
msgid "The code. All codes are listed in :ref:`hub-api-codes`."
msgstr "原因码。所有原因码列于 :ref:`hub-api-codes`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:75
msgid "``error``"
msgstr "``error``"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:76
msgid ""
"One English sentence that states what happened and what to do. After the "
"semicolon comes the next step."
msgstr "一句英文，说明发生了什么以及应做什么。分号之后是下一步。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:79
msgid ""
"Some codes carry further members, named in the table of codes (for "
"example ``stored_seq`` with ``keys_rollback``, ``challenge`` with "
"``pow_required``, and ``max_bits`` with ``bucket_too_narrow``). A "
"response with status 429, 502, 503 or 507 carries ``Retry-After`` in "
"seconds."
msgstr ""
"部分原因码带有其他成员，列于原因码表中（例如 ``keys_rollback`` 带 "
"``stored_seq``，``pow_required`` 带 ``challenge``，``bucket_too_narrow`` 带 "
"``max_bits``）。状态为 429、502、503 或 507 的响应带有以秒计的 ``Retry-After``\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:84
msgid ""
"The sentences of a hub are in English only. The daemon maps hub codes to "
"the sentences of its own reason table, in the language of the node (see "
":doc:`reason-codes`)."
msgstr "hub 的语句仅有英文。守护进程把 hub 的原因码映射到自己原因表中的语句，语言取决于节点（参见 :doc:`reason-codes`）。"

