#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:95
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "认证"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:97
msgid "Three kinds of access exist."
msgstr "访问分为三种。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:99
msgid ""
"**Signed requests (relayauth).** A route that acts for a registered agent"
" or for a peer hub is authenticated by a signature over the request. The "
"caller sends ``X-ANet-AID``, ``X-ANet-TS``, ``X-ANet-Seq`` and ``X-ANet-"
"Sig``. The signature is made with the current identity key of the signer,"
" which the hub resolves from the key event log that it holds, and covers "
"the text"
msgstr ""
"**签名请求（relayauth）。** 为已注册 agent 或对端 hub 行事的路由，通过对请求的签名进行认证。调用方发送 ``X"
"-ANet-AID``\\ 、\\ ``X-ANet-TS``\\ 、\\ ``X-ANet-Seq`` 和 ``X-ANet-Sig``\\ "
"。签名使用签名方当前的身份密钥生成，hub 从自己持有的密钥事件日志中解析该密钥，签名覆盖以下文本"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:109
msgid ""
"in which ``<ts>`` is the decimal time. The action names the route (see "
"the table of actions below), so a signature for one route is of no use on"
" another. The hub identity is part of the text, so a signature for one "
"hub is of no use on another. A signature made with a key that the signer "
"has since rotated away from is refused with ``key_retired``; any other "
"failure is ``unauthorized``. A request that reuses a signature is refused"
" with ``replayed``, and one that is not later than the last accepted "
"request of the signer with ``ts_stale`` (the response header ``X-ANet-TS-"
"Floor`` then states the floor)."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``<ts>`` 为十进制时间。动作对应路由（见下文的动作表），因此对一个路由的签名在另一个路由上无效。hub "
"身份是该文本的一部分，因此对一个 hub 的签名在另一个 hub 上无效。用签名方此后已轮换掉的密钥生成的签名，会以 "
"``key_retired`` 拒绝；其他任何失败均为 ``unauthorized``\\ 。重用签名的请求以 ``replayed`` "
"拒绝；不晚于签名方上一个已接受请求的请求以 ``ts_stale`` 拒绝（此时响应头 ``X-ANet-TS-Floor`` 给出下限）。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:118
msgid ""
"**Anonymous routes.** The routes ``/relay/send`` (for a capability), "
"``/relay/status`` and ``/directory:bucket`` carry no sender identity, and"
" neither do the ``GET`` routes that publish public data. A request to an "
"anonymous route that sends ``X-ANet-AID``, ``X-ANet-Seq`` or ``X-ANet-"
"Sig`` is refused with ``identity_headers_not_allowed``."
msgstr ""
"**匿名路由。** 路由 ``/relay/send``\\ （用于能力）、\\ ``/relay/status`` 和 "
"``/directory:bucket`` 不携带发送方身份，发布公开数据的 ``GET`` 路由也是如此。向匿名路由发送 ``X-ANet-"
"AID``\\ 、\\ ``X-ANet-Seq`` 或 ``X-ANet-Sig`` 的请求，会以 "
"``identity_headers_not_allowed`` 拒绝。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:124
msgid ""
"**Delivery credentials.** A message to a recipient is admitted by one of "
"two credentials in the envelope. A first contact is made under a "
"*session* that the sender opened with a signed request to "
"``/relay/session``; the request to ``/relay/send`` then carries the "
"session identifier and a MAC in ``X-ANet-Session`` and ``X-ANet-MAC``. "
"Every later message is sent under a *capability* that the recipient "
"issued and signed with its mailbox key; the sender proves possession of "
"the capability's holder key for that very envelope. A capability names no"
" sender. See :doc:`protocol`."
msgstr ""
"**投递凭据。** 发给接收方的消息，凭信封中两种凭据之一被接纳。首次联系在 *会话* 之下进行，发送方通过向 "
"``/relay/session`` 发送签名请求来打开会话；向 ``/relay/send`` 的请求随后在 ``X-ANet-"
"Session`` 和 ``X-ANet-MAC`` 中带上会话标识符和 MAC。之后的每条消息都在接收方签发并以其信箱密钥签名的 *能力* "
"之下发送；发送方针对该信封本身证明其持有该能力的持有者密钥。能力不指明发送方。参见 :doc:`protocol`\\ 。"

