#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:140
msgid "Relay"
msgstr "中继"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:142
msgid ""
"The relay accepts sealed envelopes into the mailbox of the recipient, "
"serves the mailbox to its owner and answers questions about delivery."
msgstr "中继将密封信封接纳到接收方的信箱，向信箱所有者提供信箱，并回答有关投递的询问。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:145
msgid ""
"``POST /relay/send`` accepts the raw envelope bytes with the content type"
" ``application/vnd.anet.envelope+cbor``. The answer has ``status`` "
"(``queued`` or ``duplicate``) and ``rid``, a random identifier with which"
" the sender asks later whether the envelope was collected. The answer "
"carries no message identifier and no warning."
msgstr ""
"``POST /relay/send`` 接受原始信封字节，内容类型为 "
"``application/vnd.anet.envelope+cbor``\\ 。应答包含 ``status``\\ （``queued`` 或"
" ``duplicate``）和 ``rid``，后者是随机标识符，发送方之后可凭它询问信封是否已被取走。应答不带消息标识符，也不带警告。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:150
msgid ""
"``POST /relay/poll`` returns up to ``limit`` envelopes of the mailbox of "
"the signer, after ``after_id``. The answer may carry the current witness "
"notice of the signer in ``key_state_notice``. Envelopes whose expiry has "
"passed are not returned."
msgstr ""
"``POST /relay/poll`` 返回签名方信箱中 ``after_id`` 之后最多 ``limit`` 个信封。应答可在 "
"``key_state_notice`` 中携带签名方当前的 witness notice。已过期的信封不会返回。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:153
msgid ""
"``POST /relay/ack`` removes envelopes from the mailbox. An item may carry"
" the delivery confirmation (``dack``) that the hub stores for the sender."
msgstr "``POST /relay/ack`` 从信箱中移除信封。条目可以携带送达确认（``dack``），由 hub 为发送方保存。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:155
msgid ""
"``POST /relay/status`` lets a sender ask anonymously whether an envelope "
"was collected. An item answers ``queued``, ``done`` (with the ``dack``) "
"or ``unknown``. A request holds 1 to 64 items. The hub keeps a delivery "
"confirmation for 7 days, and for a shorter time after it was fetched. A "
"client address may ask at a refill of 10 requests per second with a burst"
" of 50 (429 ``rate_limited``)."
msgstr ""
"``POST /relay/status`` 让发送方匿名询问某信封是否已被取走。条目的应答为 ``queued``、``done``\\ （带 "
"``dack``）或 ``unknown``。一次请求包含 1 到 64 个条目。hub 把送达确认保留 7 "
"天，被取走之后保留更短的时间。同一客户端地址按每秒 10 次请求的速率补充、突发上限 50 次（429 ``rate_limited``）。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:160
msgid ""
"``POST /mailbox/revoke`` lets a mailbox owner revoke capabilities it "
"issued. A request carries 1 to 1000 capability identifiers and is limited"
" by a bucket of its own. A revocation is kept for 31 days, and one owner "
"may have at most 100,000 unexpired revocations here "
"(``revocation_list_full``); its node then starts a new mailbox key epoch,"
" which invalidates every credential of the old key at once."
msgstr ""
"``POST /mailbox/revoke`` 让邮箱所有者撤销它签发的能力凭据。一次请求携带 1 到 1000 "
"个能力标识，并受独立的令牌桶限制。撤销记录保留 31 天，一个所有者在此最多可有 100,000 "
"条未过期的撤销（``revocation_list_full``）；其节点随后会启动新的邮箱密钥纪元，使旧密钥的所有凭据立即失效。"

#: ../../reference/hub-api.rst:167
msgid ""
"A mailbox holds at most 5000 envelopes and 1 GiB per recipient by default"
" (status 507 above), an envelope may be at most 96 MiB by default (status"
" 413 above), and an undelivered envelope is kept for 14 days at most (see"
" :doc:`cli` for the flags). Messages from senders that are not yet "
"contacts of the recipient pass through a separate channel. By default one"
" recipient takes 30 first contacts per minute and at most 500 messages "
"and 64 MiB from senders that are not its contacts; the operator can raise"
" these values for a single recipient with ``anet-hub quota``."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，每个接收方的信箱最多容纳 5000 个信封和 1 GiB（超过则返回状态 507），单个信封最大 96 MiB（超过则返回状态 "
"413），未投递的信封最长保留 14 天（标志见 "
":doc:`cli`）。尚不是接收方联系人的发送方发来的消息，经由单独的通道通过。默认情况下，一个接收方每分钟接受 30 "
"次首次联系，并接受非联系人发来的最多 500 条消息和 64 MiB；运营人员可以用 ``anet-hub quota`` "
"为单个接收方提高这些值。"

